flowchart TD
    Tracker(["Tracker view"]) --> Trigger["User taps 'Re-plan'\n(or app offers it after\nbehind-schedule detection)"]

    Trigger --> Suggest["AI pre-computes a recommendation:\n'Based on your pace, I'd suggest\nextending ~2 weeks, everything\nelse stays the same'"]

    Suggest --> QuickChoice{"User response"}
    QuickChoice -->|Accept suggestion| Apply
    QuickChoice -->|Customize| PathChoice{"Continue this plan or\nStart fresh (your current\nplan is saved, not deleted)?"}

    PathChoice -->|Start fresh| Confirm["Confirm dialog"]
    Confirm --> Archive["Archive current roadmap\n(read-only, preserved)"]
    Archive --> NewOnboard(["Redirect to Onboarding"])

    PathChoice -->|Continue this plan| DeadlineChoice{"Keep same deadline\nor extend timeline?"}

    DeadlineChoice -->|Keep same deadline| CalcPace["Calculate required pace\nfor remaining tasks to hit\nexisting target_end_date"]
    CalcPace --> RealismCheck{"Required pace exceeds\nhours_per_week by\n> ~30%?"}
    RealismCheck -->|Yes| Warning["Warning screen:\n'You'd need ~X hrs/week vs\nyour Y hrs/week available'"]
    Warning --> WarningChoice{"User decision"}
    WarningChoice -->|Keep deadline anyway| Apply
    WarningChoice -->|Extend timeline instead| CalcExtend
    RealismCheck -->|No| Apply["Apply repaced_weeks\n(completed tasks untouched)"]

    DeadlineChoice -->|Extend timeline| CalcExtend["Calculate new target_end_date\npreserving ~original pace"]
    CalcExtend --> ConfirmExtend["Show new target_end_date\nfor confirmation"]
    ConfirmExtend --> Apply

    Apply --> Back(["Back to Tracker\nwith updated roadmap"])
